            <h2>Certificaciones</h2>
            <ul class="cert-list">
                <li>C# with Microsoft - Microsoft</li>
                <li>Azure Fundamentals - Microsoft</li>
                <li>Scrum Foundation - CertiProf</li>
                <li>OWASP Top 10 Secure Development - GM Sectec</li>
